OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,FMonday and Tuesday with variable cloud
OL,7,Finterspersed with bright and sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Bright spells and perhaps
OL,9,Fshowers on Wednesday. Overnight frost
OL,10,Fand fog possible under clearer skies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
